g window.)Tj-18 -20 TD -0.027 Tc (To begin \336ltering, select a \336lter type from the pull-down list. A pop-up box )Tj0 -12 TD 0 Tc (will ask you to select a \336lter size.)Tj/F10 9 Tf97.991 -147 TD (Fig.10-18. Selecting a filter size.)Tj/F6 10 Tf-97.991 -21.75 TD (The available \336lter dimensions range from 3)Tj/F1 10 Tf194.346 0 TD ( x )Tj/F6 10 Tf10.322 0 TD (3 pixels to 9)Tj/F1 10 Tf51.909 0 TD ( x )Tj/F6 10 Tf10.322 0 TD (9 pixels. \(See the )Tj-266.898 -12 TD (previous section for guidance on selecting a size.\))TjETq 227.5 0 0 109.25 210.25 235 cm/I100 Doendstreamendobj1104 0 obj2591endobj1106 0 obj<</Type /XObject/Subtype /Image/Name /I100/Filter /FlateDecode /Width 325/Height 156/BitsPerComponent 8/ColorSpace [ /Indexed /DeviceRGB 255 1105 0 R ]/Length 1107 0 R>>stream
