ands will not \336lter )Tj0 -12 TD (for shadows.)Tj/F7 11 Tf-9 -27.5 TD (Band Limit)Tj/F6 10 Tf9 -20.5 TD (If you know that all the lanes in your gel image contain a speci\336c number of )Tj0 -12 TD -0.374 Tw (bands, you can click on the Limit button next to the Bands prompt and type in )TjT* 0 Tw (the number of bands that you know are present. Only that number of bands )TjT* (will be detected in each lane, reducing the need for later editing.)TjETendstreamendobj1336 0 obj2462endobj1334 0 obj<</Type /Page/Parent 1313 0 R/Resources <</Font <</F4 16 0 R /F6 20 0 R /F7 25 0 R /F9 48 0 R >>/ProcSet 2 0 R>>/Contents 1335 0 R>>endobj1338 0 obj<</Length 1339 0 R>>stream
